OL,3,GNEWSAMan appears in court over double  
OL,4,Afatal crash                            
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court over the   
OL,7,Fdeaths of two women who were killed in 
OL,8,Fa crash that also left a nine-year-old 
OL,9,Fboy with life-changing injuries.       
OL,11,FAmie Pearson, 26, and Chelsea Carlisle,
OL,12,F29, were travelling in a Suzuki Alto   
OL,13,Fwith the boy, now 10, when the car was 
OL,14,Finvolved in a crash with a Vauxhall    
OL,15,FMeriva in Pleasley, on the             
OL,16,FDerbyshire-Nottinghamshire border, at  
OL,17,Fabout 06:20 GMT on 27 November 2025.   
OL,19,FA passenger in the Vauxhall also       
OL,20,Fsuffered serious injuries, police said.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
