OL,3,GNEWSAMan appears in court over double  
OL,4,Afatal crash                            
OL,6,FOn Thursday, Emmanuel Chinyanga        
OL,7,Fappeared at Southern Derbyshire        
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court charged with driving
OL,9,Foffences, including two counts of      
OL,10,Fcausing death by dangerous driving, and
OL,11,Fhis case was sent to Derby Crown Court.
